# Vim editing: search, multi-cursor rename, undo, fuzzy-open another file.
Hide
Type "cd /tmp/demo/throttle && clear && red src/bucket.rs"
Enter
Wait+Screen@30s /NORMAL/
Sleep 7s
Show
Sleep 1.2s
Type "/earned"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 900ms
Ctrl+N
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+N
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+N
Sleep 700ms
Type "c"
Sleep 300ms
Type "gained"
Escape
Sleep 1.4s
Screenshot "a-hero.png"
Type "u"
Sleep 1.2s
Ctrl+P
Sleep 700ms
Type "win"
Sleep 1.6s
Enter
Sleep 1.2s
Type "/pop_front"
Enter
Sleep 800ms
Type "dd"
Sleep 900ms
Type "u"
Sleep 1.6s
